check 1
# Level generation of the Lut Gholein Sewers Level 1 (level 47): ScnAm2
# starts in Lut Gholein (act II open), -seed 1234, idle until frame 20,
# then the level warp (poke `warp 47`, tile 0) on both sides. Compare the
# dungeon's rooms, presets and populated units, and the draws
# (record_rng.py with the poke). Area C (level generation). Spec:
# specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name a2-warp-sewers-ama
save ScnAm2 --class ama --expansion --act 1 --quests acts=1
seed 1234
ticks 160
seconds 900
channels state rng
at 20 poke warp 47
